  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Original SwTableBox registers as a SwClient at document-owned native SwTableBoxFormat with exact aTableBoxSetRange, default parent and pooled concrete vertical item. Explicit three-field records remain construction/transport boundaries only.",
    "CheckBoxFormat excludes direct formula/value items when a native box format already owns another box; ClaimFrameFormat copies complete direct items/inheritance/auto state and separates other box clients before writes. Concrete calculation and number-format engines remain unimplemented.",
    "ChgFrameFormat emits native TableBoxFormatChanged before model registration unless the native loading flag suppresses it, and destroys a format after its final represented client. Native SwCellFrame client retargeting and full physical cell frame hierarchy remain absent.",
    "SetSwTabBorders uses an operation-local old format and native changed-side type map; SetBoxAttr reuses old-to-new native owners. Both write directly into claimed item sets and preserve complete unrelated native items, peers and document-owned attribute history.",
    "SaveTable deduplicates full direct native cell item sets and saves numeric indices. Restoration creates shared document-owned native formats, broadcasts MoveTableBoxHint before original box registration and deletes empty old formats. Physical frame/numeric attribute differences from native MoveTableBox remain incomplete.",
    "Native insertion shares source cell formats; destructive row/column/table node removal releases original cell clients; ordinary RemoveBox remains nondestructive. Main JSX rendering reads original native cell border/orientation items directly; mounted command/Undo/Redo tests reject cell DTO calls.",
    "All654 prior acceptance files are preserved:649 byte-identical and five exact native constructor or expected-before-destruction migrations. All316 metadata records/status/default/classification/order/prefixes retained, no promotion. Registered IO/recovery deviations, whole writer-view and stash preserved; goal ACTIVE."
  ]
}
